\f0\fs24 \cf0 (Giris)\
\
Dunya-hum malun wa baytun wa zina\
Lakin qalbi yahtaju Rabbi dina\
Yarkuduna wara lahzatin fana\
Wa ana abhathu an nuri al-baqa\
\
(Kita 1)\
\
Qalu lima anta ghayruhum fi tariq\
Qultu qalbi ila Rabbi yashuq\
In adhavni bi qawlin aw ihtiqar\
Fa Rabbi ya'lamu sirri wa jahar\
\
(Nakarat)\
\
Ya Rabbi anta ghayati wa ridak\
La uridu ghayra nuri liqak\
In kana tafawuti fi hubbik\
Fa bihadha al-farqi aftakhir bik\
\
Ya Rabbi anta ghayati wa ridak\
Dunya fana wa baqa liqak\
In kanu la yafhamuna qalbi\
Fa anta ta'lamu sirri wa darbi\
\
(Kita 2)\
\
Qad zannuni ghayran baynahum\
Wa jarrahu qalbi bi zannihim\
Fa sabartu hatta fahimtu al-amr\
Anna ridaka ya Rabbi huwa al-fakhr\
\
(Nakarat)\
\
Ya Rabbi anta ghayati wa ridak\
La uridu ghayra nuri liqak\
In kana tafawuti fi hubbik\
Fa bihadha al-farqi aftakhir bik\
\
(Son)\
\
Fal-yarkudu wara dunya zahra\
Wa ana as'alu jannatan wa maghfira\
In kuntu faridan fi tariq al-huda\
Fa hasbi Rabbi wa ni'ma al-mawla}